    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328a460747092ddf3bf242e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“东京大赏典”当天。训练员仿照\n小林历奇出道那天的幸运色，\n穿着橘色外套来到赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab42d4390d6bc1978b586a00c6cce381429be56f01bcccd2298419c86586743",
