    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc1efbb60f328e1c3780725",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇原本以为只要变强到能与劲敌们\n并驾齐驱，就足以证明风水的力量。\n但光是这样还不够。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6ed8c0a66f48ba0dc768fe688408844a56c48be4b9b26c728e5de50332fbf7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e0dc5327eee73634cdb7c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
