    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96cb15a881cbcb895d11c92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来以为她接下来会想登上大舞台，\n但她却慎重地表示要先增强实力，因为风水\n并非万能，只能让人比较容易发挥实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3afa2bb212e2fdfee54f367e186cf9da4d3503f62eac78cfb3b6af58394593a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
