    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa83ad36bfbe9031f7079c98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，北港火山成功称霸了重赏比赛。\n她表示愿意帮助自己和为自己加油的人\n是很重要的，小林历奇也认同她的看法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9726dab70ee825fce8bac24bb8b75cf1f97c9ecd09648f53238e138a7faa49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
