    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d9053697b3f84a844ecd41c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇决定将接下来的目标，\n定为“招揽粉丝”和寻找\n愿意协助自己训练的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f7f01e8b528099757dafccd86f0d76cb9cb028253fb37b0042874dc0c9ffa2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
