    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a218d163cbbf53adbd704c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级的三冠路线比较能够引人注目，\n也有利于推广风水。该跑沙土还是草地──\n小林历奇必须做出抉择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8762b509b002f3685ac0bf029e25cb9300c892fd1992ae905615d4745e98adf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
