    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98763f14cd6021a474160b0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决定先参加沙土的“卧龙锦标”确认资质，\n然后再重新检讨是否要挑战草地GⅠ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41bff29c847b4a97f6f5e6cae0fe02bba60dbfb61d07094e464e4ed5904dd92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
